        <https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2026/502/cod/doc/com/COM_2026_502/FINAL/eng/tit_4> ;
    dcterms:description "A dedicated Union repository of cloud computing services that have received recognition. To be established and maintained by the Commission. National competent authorities shall register the relevant services in this repository."@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "interop/1" ;
    dcterms:title "Union repository of recognised sovereign services"@en .

